{'symbol': 'KMB', 'date': '2021-03-31 08:30:00', 'title': 'KIMBERLY-CLARK ANNOUNCES PRICE INCREASES FOR NORTH AMERICAN CONSUMER PRODUCTS BUSINESS', 'text': 'DALLAS, MARCH 31, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KIMBERLY-CLARK CORPORATION (NYSE: KMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT IS NOTIFYING CUSTOMERS IN THE U.S. AND CANADA OF PLANS TO INCREASE NET SELLING PRICES ACROSS A MAJORITY OF ITS NORTH AMERICA CONSUMER PRODUCTS BUSINESS. THE INCREASES WILL BE IMPLEMENTED ALMOST ENTIRELY THROUGH CHANGES IN LIST PRICES AND ARE NECESSARY TO HELP OFFSET SIGNIFICANT COMMODITY COST INFLATION.'}